# BANNERFALL: a battle that brings in a new troop opens with a line about it
# (battle 1: footmen in columns of three); a champion called by the fifth
# promotion arrives with a banner.
game bannerfall
wait 5
cheat battle 1
expect tip == 1
wait 300
expect tip == 0
cheat battle 2
expect tip == 1
cheat battle 3
expect tip == 0
cheat battle 24
cheat clear
cheat promos 4
cheat unit 3 2 1 0
cheat unit 4 2 1 1 1
cheat endturn
wait 50
expect hero_due_l == 0
expect champs_l == 1
expect banner == 3
expect promos_l == 0
